name count1to
category Package
revision 79618
shortdesc Make use of count1 to count9
longdesc A LaTeX package which sets count 1 (to 'absolute' page number),
longdesc counts 2-8 to the numbers of the current \part, \chapter
longdesc (always 0 in article class), ... \subparagraph, and count 9 to
longdesc 1 or 0, according to whether the page is odd or even. These
longdesc values can be used to select pages with some drivers. The
longdesc package uses the everyshi package.
